      "title": "ANUP: Upcoming Shareholder And Board Actions Will Support Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have kept their price target on Anup Engineering steady at ₹3,000, citing largely unchanged assumptions around revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E, supported by a slightly lower discount rate that fine tunes rather than shifts their overall valuation view. What's in the News A special shareholders meeting is scheduled for Mar 11, 2026 via postal ballot in India to consider amendments to the Anup employee stock option scheme 2019, including administering the scheme through an irrevocable employee welfare trust, adjusting the exercise price clause, and enabling secondary acquisition of shares through the trust route (Key Developments).",
